  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerz_riot/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_d07d8934-0938-40a3-9a98-35115ec750cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fgamerz_riot07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_b489e76c-8d04-4cc4-974f-8ee9c9a5b7c6.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cJ3bs3XxHr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_7bf6a59b-bf4a-4867-8bdf-2d31fd360227.png\" width=\"196\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Gamerz_Riot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_7f1a7c2a-b5f5-4a60-a7f4-280b1e85792b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"196\" height=\"59\"></a></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">⛯</span></span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">链接</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">⛯</span></span></strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&amp;url=https://toppng.com/instagram-logo-circle-PNG-free-PNG-Images_79801&amp;psig=AOvVaw00odNRdAatiHsbge0BntMM&amp;ust=1668095020051000&amp;source=images&amp;cd=vfe&amp;ved=0CA0QjRxqFwoTCKiR_ay4ofsCFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">⮞</span></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#fbeeb8\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252foneblock-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">OneBlock Reborn</span> [数据包]</strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></span></a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">⮜</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&amp;url=https://toppng.com/instagram-logo-circle-PNG-free-PNG-Images_79801&amp;psig=AOvVaw00odNRdAatiHsbge0BntMM&amp;ust=1668095020051000&amp;source=images&amp;cd=vfe&amp;ved=0CA0QjRxqFwoTCKiR_ay4ofsCFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\" alt=\"\">⮞</span><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/skyblock-horizon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">SkyBlock Horizon</span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"> [地图]</span></a></span>&nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">⮜</span></span></span></strong></span></p><hr><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">在最后的<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">1.21更新</span>之后，OneBlock Reborn地图<br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">将成为一个独立的地图生成数据包</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></pre><hr><h1><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>⛯<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"> </span></strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>OneBlock Reborn</strong></span></h1><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f0f\"><strong>OneBlock Reborn</strong></span> 是一款冒险地图，它是<strong>IJAMinecraft的OneBlock地图</strong>的延续。在这张地图中，你将出生在一个悬浮于虚空之上的单个方块上。这个方块是无限的，并根据不同的生物群系经历不同的阶段。地图充满了冒险和挑战。</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>⛯ </strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">在社交媒体上展示时请注明来源。</span></strong></span></span></h1><p>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&gt;</span></strong> 下载 OneBlock：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn</a><br>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&gt;</span></strong> 下载原始版本（IJAMinecraft）：<a href=\"ijaminecraft.com/map/oneblock/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ijaminecraft.com/oneblock</a></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">⛯ </span>关于：&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在这张地图中，你将出生在一个单独的方块上。地图包含15个阶段，每个阶段都有不同且独特的主题。你还可以进入<span style=\"color:#f00\">下界</span>或<span style=\"color:#00f\">末地</span>。<br></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">方块和生物会根据地图中的阶段生成。地图中添加了方解石和凝灰岩的配方（见图片）。</span></strong></span></span>&nbsp; OneBlock Reborn 以前称为 OneBlock Classic。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>视频教程</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"width:255px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rvbzk_GaeJw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:261px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7TOImSxgZts?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:262px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kmjZSxd0h1A?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>! 如何安装！（单人游戏）</strong></span></p><ul style=\"font-weight:400\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">下载地图并使用 WinRAR 或 7Z 解压。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">解压后你将得到一个文件夹。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">然后将文件夹<span style=\"color:#036\"><em><strong>复制</strong>&nbsp;</em></span>或<span style=\"color:#036\"><em><strong>移动</strong>&nbsp;</em></span>到 <span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>minecraft saves</strong></span> 文件夹中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">就这样，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\"><strong>OneBlock</strong></span> 就安装好了。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">现在你可以在<strong>Minecraft</strong>中享受它了。<br></span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>! 如何安装！（多人游戏）</strong></span></p><ul style=\"font-weight:400\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">下载地图并使用 WinRAR 或 7Z 解压。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">现在将解压后的文件夹<em><strong>重命名</strong></em>为 \"<span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>world</strong></span>\"。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">然后，<span style=\"color:#036\"><strong><em><strong><em>上传</em></strong> \"<span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>world</strong></span>\" 文件夹到你的服务器主机</em></strong></span>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">就这样，<span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">OneBlock</span></strong></span> 就安装在你的<strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">服务器</span></strong>上了。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">现在你可以在你的<strong>Minecraft 服务器</strong>中享受它了。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>鸣谢 / 链接</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/IJAMinecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>IJAMinecraft 的 YouTube 频道。</strong></span></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fijaminecraft.com%252fmap%252foneblock%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>IJAMinecraft 的 OneBlock 项目。</strong></span></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBxC-rDu4a2SKFdDPXfVxmw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></strong></span></span></span></p>",
